  "changes": [
    "Shared column-parallel FFT authority moved from Full to neutral domain_transform; bounded native SIMD row ranges.",
    "One-shot joined pool waves, drained partial submissions and no shared mutable output cursors.",
    "Physical-order ALU main writing with bounded private histogram workers and start-gate cancellation before borrowed writes.",
    "CPU and ALU native interaction chunks/prefix correction use bounded joined waves; serial reference retained.",
    "Reuse sealed ROM inverse dictionary; no per-step repeated ROM denominator/inversion or raw PC unpacking in cached path.",
    "Release committed interaction source matrices while retaining physical claims and source metadata.",
    "Immutable full64 address IDs replace eight PC limbs with two scalar IDs in concrete indexed CPU; no extra runtime representation enum."
  ],
